EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Outta my way!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Don't interrupt me when I'm trying
to catch the coolest bug ever!{{TAG:000B:0004:01CD}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Oh, t'abuses là, sérieux !!!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} Je suis
sur le point d'attraper un insecte
que je vise depuis une heure{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}.{{TAG:000B:0004:01CD}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Va' via!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:001B:}}Non mi distrarre!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Sto per catturare l'insetto
più trendy che esista!{{TAG:000B:0004:01CD}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Argh! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Aus dem Weg, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}aus dem Weg!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Hallo?! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich versuche gerade das
coolste Insekt aller Zeiten zu
fangen!{{TAG:000B:0004:01CD}}

TRANSLATION:
